{
    "description": "Enhanced boundary coverage for the enum-value registry map. Exercises input-order preservation while non-enumeration descriptors are ignored, the `enumModel` category alias, de-duplication of repeated enum names, and de-duplication against the built-in seeded `MaterialTapTargetSize` entry.",
    "cases": [
